          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction&#x27;s denominator by the whole number.</p>",
            "readable_text": "To divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's denominator by the whole number.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, to calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{5} \\div {\\color{blue}2},]</span> we multiply the fraction&#x27;s denominator by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: {\\color{blue}2}\\!:]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{5} \\div {\\color{blue}2}  = \\dfrac{1}{5 \\times {\\color{blue}2}} = \\dfrac{1}{10}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, to calculate [MATH: \\dfrac{1}{5} \\div {\\color{blue}2},] we multiply the fraction's denominator by [MATH: {\\color{blue}2}\\!:]\n[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{5} \\div {\\color{blue}2} = \\dfrac{1}{5 \\times {\\color{blue}2}} = \\dfrac{1}{10}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Notice that we get the same answer using a fraction model, and the process is similar.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Notice that we get the same answer using a fraction model, and the process is similar.",
