          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction&#x27;s denominator by that whole number:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{4} \\div 3  = \\dfrac{1}{4 \\times 3} = \\dfrac{1}{12}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To divide a unit fraction by a whole number, we multiply the fraction's denominator by that whole number:\n[MATH: \\dfrac{1}{4} \\div 3 = \\dfrac{1}{4 \\times 3} = \\dfrac{1}{12}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
